# PC card pc-melee-floor (docs/bench/melee-top3.md, MGUN-26, BENCH-192): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 fresh seeds (3304-3309, after pc-melee-far's 3288-3295), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant; the bench drops the robots broken-1.11.2.txt lists (BENCH-169). Template: mlprep writes work/melee-floor-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, z4, z5); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
